  Copy this folder to: sdmc:/switch/NXStation/data/theme/YourThemeName/
  Then select it in Settings → Theme.

  Optional schema-2 features (all optional — a colors-only theme still works):
    layout="dashboard"  home renders as a dashboard (see <sections> below)
    <style>             design tokens: fonts, card radius/padding, platform tiles, focus glow
    <sections>          dashboard section order + visibility
-->
